{"t":"CHRW","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"C.H. Robinson Worldwide, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Integrated Freight & Logistics","employees":11479,"hq":"Eden Prairie, MN, United States","website":"https://www.chrobinson.com","summary_en":"C.H. Robinson Worldwide, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides freight transportation and related logistics and supply chain services in the United States and internationally. It operates in two segments, North American Surface Transportation and Global Forwarding. The company offers transportation and logistics services, such as truckload; less than truckload transportation brokerage services, which include the shipment of single or multiple pallets of freight; intermodal transportation that comprises the shipment service of freight in containers or trailers by a combination of truck and rail; and non-vessel operating common carrier and freight forwarding services, as well as organizes indirect air carrier and freight forwarder providing door-to-door services. It also provides customs brokerage services; and other logistics services, such as fee-based managed, warehousing, supply chain consulting and optimization services, and other services. In addition, the company is involved in the buying, selling, and/or marketing of fresh fruits, vegetables, and other value-added perishable items under the Robinson Fresh trade name. Further, the company offers transportation management and other surface transportation services. It provides fresh produce to grocery retailers, restaurants, produce wholesalers. C.H. Robinson Worldwide, Inc. was founded in 1905 and is headquartered in Eden Prairie, Minnesota.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"C.H. Robinson Worldwide, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 미국 및 국제적으로 화물 운송, 관련 물류 및 공급망 서비스를 제공합니다. 북미 육상 운송과 글로벌 포워딩이라는 두 부문으로 운영됩니다. 회사는 트럭 운송과 같은 운송 및 물류 서비스를 제공합니다. 단일 또는 다중 화물 팔레트 배송을 포함하는 트럭 운송 중개 서비스 미만 트럭과 철도를 결합하여 컨테이너 또는 트레일러에 화물을 운송하는 복합운송; 비선박 운영 일반 운송업체 및 화물 운송 서비스를 제공할 뿐만 아니라 간접 항공 운송업체 및 화물 운송업체를 조직하여 Door-to-Door 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 통관 중개 서비스도 제공합니다. 수수료 기반 관리, 창고 보관, 공급망 컨설팅 및 최적화 서비스 및 기타 서비스와 같은 기타 물류 서비스. 또한 회사는 Robinson Fresh 상표명으로 신선한 과일, 야채 및 기타 부패하기 쉬운 부가가치 품목의 구매, 판매 및/또는 마케팅에 참여하고 있습니다. 또한 회사는 운송 관리 및 기타 육상 운송 서비스를 제공합니다. 식료품 소매업체, 레스토랑, 농산물 도매업체에 신선한 농산물을 제공합니다. C.H. Robinson Worldwide, Inc.는 1905년에 설립되었으며 미네소타주 Eden Prairie에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":128.31,"mcap":14876470272.0,"pe":23.035906,"fpe":17.180733,"peg":1.5999,"ps":0.81659317,"pb":9.41863,"ev_ebitda":16.782,"div":1.96,"beta":0.947,"hi52":210.33,"lo52":122.21},"fin":{"rev":18217725952.0,"rev_g":0.295,"eps_g":0.246,"gross":0.08342,"op":0.05661,"net":0.03671,"roe":0.38924998,"fcf":379530240.0,"cash":193132000.0,"debt":2152386048.0,"de":136.28,"eps":5.57,"feps":7.46825},"own":{"short":0.0574,"inst":1.05656,"insider":0.0034999999},"analyst":{"n":23,"mean":179.30435,"median":180.0,"high":235.0,"low":131.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.6087,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":14,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":14,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":15,"hold":4,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":4,"buy":14,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Susquehanna","ToGrade":"Positive","FromGrade":"Positive","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":166.0,"priorPriceTarget":180.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":174.0,"priorPriceTarget":198.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":183.0,"priorPriceTarget":185.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":204.0,"